[31m-[m
[31m-**| Dry Feed  |  500 g |          6.0% |            35.34 g |**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**| Dry Feed  | 1000 g |      \*\*5.4%\*\* |            47.56 g |**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**| Wet Feed  |  500 g |         12.0% |            77.06 g |**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**| Wet Feed  | 1000 g |         10.2% |            88.67 g |**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
