[31m-**## 🔐 Safety \& Security**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**The system applies multiple protection mechanisms.**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**### Fail-Safe Feed Protection**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**When the ultrasonic sensor detects a critical stock distance of \*\*32 cm or more\*\*, motor execution is cancelled to prevent inaccurate or empty feeding cycles.**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**### Authentication**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Firebase Authentication is used to prevent unauthorized application access.**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**### Rule-Based Access Control**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Critical nodes such as schedules and actuator-related parameters are restricted to authorized users, while device access is limited according to its intended role.**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**### Network Dependency**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**The automatic scheduling mechanism relies on \*\*NTP synchronization through an internet connection\*\*. Because the low-cost prototype does not include a physical RTC module, loss of connectivity can prevent scheduled execution.**[m
